{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","噩兆缠身"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","巴登与幻影对指定敌人发动强力攻击，并使其无法恢复生命值和能量持续一定时间。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","巴登与场上幻影同时向指定敌人发起4段攻击并持续眩晕目标，前3段攻击各造成150% + 15% ATK伤害，最后一段攻击对目标及其周围1格范围内的敌人造成420% + 50% ATK真实伤害，吸收目标200% + 20% ATK生命并施加等量的生命削减。该技能还会使目标无法回复生命值和能量持续8秒。技能释放期间巴登处于无敌状态。自动战斗时，该技能优先选择最虚弱的敌人作为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":80,"end":86,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":103,"end":109,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":76,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":99,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":121,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"},{"start":159,"end":161,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":177,"end":181,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","最后一段攻击伤害量提高至440% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","最后一段攻击伤害量提高至460% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","最后一段攻击伤害量提高至480% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","最后一段攻击伤害量提高至500% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","贯魂噩影"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时诅咒前方同一轴线上的敌人，在其生命值较低时召唤幻影协助战斗。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，诅咒前方同一轴线上的敌人并对其造成250% + 30% ATK真实伤害，其中被诅咒的非首领敌人生命比例首次低于50%，或首领敌人每损耗巴登600%初始攻击力的生命后，在其周围产生一个能够释放普通攻击且优先攻击该敌人的幻影。幻影继承巴登60% + 5%的基础属性且处于无敌状态，每名首领敌人至多因此产生2个幻影。\n主动释放时，巴登贯穿当前敌人，使其眩晕持续3秒，并偷取目标共20% + 2%最大生命值（不超过自身200% + 20%攻击力）和100点能量，随后造成240% + 30% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":126,"end":131,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":195,"end":200,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":215,"end":221,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":241,"end":247,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":139,"end":141,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":237,"end":251,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害量提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害量提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害量提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_po